Z||000000||frontal lobe||09-15-2000||03:59 PM||||They just finished a big addition at my office and so moved me to a different office.  I now am looking out over the parking lot and to a golf course beyond.  Best thing about the view, though, is if I get in early enough and get the right parking lot, I can look straight out my window to literally about 30 feet to my Fiero.  I have my desk facing out the window so whenever I'm at my desk I can just look out and gaze at it.  Ahhhh.  Even during a hectic day, I can get some moments of enjoyment.  Nice set-up, I have to say.  Life is good.||||reg||1
